    <a href="/blog/career-options/career-options-for-non-cs-engineers/">career options for non-CS engineers</a>
    if you are already leaning toward a core branch and want the honest map of where it can lead. If
    you are already narrowing in on mechanical specifically, read
    <a href="/blog/career-options/is-mechanical-engineering-a-good-career-in-india/">is mechanical engineering a good career in India</a>
    for the branch-specific pay data and specialisation map. If
    you are earlier in the decision and still comparing whole streams, revisit
    <a href="/blog/stream-selection/engineering-vs-other-streams-which-is-better-career-india/">engineering vs other streams which is better career India</a>
    before narrowing further.
  </p>

